# Sheltering Ancient: "Cumulative upkeep--Put a +1/+1 counter on a creature an opponent controls." If no opponent controls a
# creature, the cost can't be paid and the Ancient is sacrificed (its ruling). Bot1 controls creatures (the Ancient itself) but Bot2
# none, so at Bot1's turn 3 upkeep paying is not offered: Bot1 is not asked, and the Ancient goes to the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Sheltering Ancient
Mox Emerald
Forest
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sheltering Ancient.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Accept
[T3 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Sheltering Ancient
